# The graphify graph: generated, rebuilt locally by the post-commit hook.
/graphify-out/

# The tasks' workspace: files needed for longer than one session, but not by the
# repository.
/workspace/

# Rust build output.
/target/

# Claude Code's own settings: local to this machine, they hold absolute paths
# of the owner's home directory.
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.local.md

# The agent's project rules and the work plans with their measurements: kept
# on the owner's machine only, out of the public repository.
/CLAUDE.md
/plans/
